Orbits that can be switched on or off, and adjustable speed.\n- Works offline after the first launch.\n\nFor schools: full access comes with a DUET STEM school subscription code. Without a code, a free 10-minute demo is available every day.", "short_description": "Stand inside a life-size Solar System: fly between the Sun, planets and moons, see real spacecraft up close, and bring the planets into your own room in mixed reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ashutoshduet.github.io/duet-lms-media/space/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DUET Power", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ashutoshduet.github.io/duet-lms-media/space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1306528595886124"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_1348314327213590_3813847281688510419_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WhKOjVQYDe0Q7kNvwGouJ2q&_nc_oc=Adpx5edifv5sNKeyZWm1fsJO5H5c3LGYRbW0x1TML85SnUOe5HhXfDJE5YdWZWcoKk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRoM84y1MMc8NboEBeDxfBUS1pPx0sIZGjn7LClKOPbcQ&oe=6B03014B"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_n